(LAST WILL AND TESTAMENT) Tj T*
(of MARGARET JOAN WILSON) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Made under the Wills Act 1997 \(Vic\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I, MARGARET JOAN WILSON, of 27 Banksia Crescent, Camberwell, Victoria 3124, retired) Tj T*
(teacher, being of sound mind, declare this to be my last will and testament. I revoke all) Tj T*
(former wills and testamentary dispositions previously made by me.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. APPOINTMENT OF EXECUTORS) Tj T*
(I appoint my son DAVID ANDREW WILSON of 12 Park Lane, Hawthorn, Victoria 3122 to be the) Tj T*
(sole executor and trustee of this my will. If David Andrew Wilson is unable or unwilling) Tj T*
(to act, I appoint my daughter EMILY KATE WILSON of 19 Glen Road, Kew, Victoria 3101 in his) Tj T*
(place.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. PAYMENT OF DEBTS) Tj T*
(I direct my executor to pay all my just debts, funeral and testamentary expenses out of my) Tj T*
(estate as soon as conveniently possible after my death.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. SPECIFIC GIFTS) Tj T*
(3.1 I give my pearl necklace and sapphire ring to my daughter EMILY KATE WILSON) Tj T*
(absolutely.) Tj T*
(3.2 I give my collection of first-edition books to my grandson THOMAS JAMES WILSON) Tj T*
(absolutely, if he survives me by 30 days.) Tj T*
(3.3 I give the sum of $20,000 to the ROYAL CHILDREN'S HOSPITAL FOUNDATION \(ABN 27 811 191) Tj T*
(990\) for its general charitable purposes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. RESIDUE) Tj T*
(I give the residue of my estate to my children DAVID ANDREW WILSON and EMILY KATE WILSON) Tj T*
(in equal shares as tenants in common. If either of them predeceases me leaving children) Tj T*
(who survive me by 30 days, those children take their parent's share equally per stirpes.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. FAMILY PROVISION) Tj T*
(I have considered my obligations to my late husband Robert Henry Wilson's son from his) Tj T*
(first marriage, JONATHAN WILSON. I have made no provision for him under this will because) Tj T*
(we have been estranged for over 20 years and he has not been part of my family life.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. POWERS) Tj T*
(My executor and trustee shall have all powers of management, investment, sale and) Tj T*
(apportionment conferred by the Trustee Act 1958 \(Vic\) and at common law and equity,) Tj T*
(including the power to postpone sale.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SIGNED by the testator MARGARET JOAN WILSON in our presence and then by us in her presence) Tj T*
(on 12 March 2026 at Camberwell, Victoria, and this signature is intended by the testator) Tj T*
(to give effect to this will.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Testator signature: M. J. Wilson) Tj T*
(Date: 12 March 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WITNESSES \(two adult witnesses present together with the testator\):) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Witness 1:) Tj T*
(Name: Helen Margaret Yu) Tj T*
(Address: 80 Camberwell Road, Camberwell, Victoria 3124) Tj T*
(Occupation: Medical practitioner) Tj T*
ET
